  "approach_chosen": "both",
  "rationale": "Top-down anchors the analysis to industry FSM/FSS software market reports; bottom-up builds from the count of US HVAC, plumbing, and electrical contractors in the SMB segment and estimated ARPU. Running both lets us cross-check the two and say what drives any gap. sizing_basis is current_year: all inputs reflect the market as it stands today, not a forecast-year projection.",
